WEBVTT

00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:14.740
End it

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:22.960
Apropos of nothing, but in Russian,
"Wet Wing Raven" means "deepest despair."

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:32.010
To use a rather romantic turn of phrase, perhaps this island was
the gathering point for people in the depths of that very despair.

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:36.640
Just as the opposite of love is not hate but indifference...

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:40.140
The opposite of hope is not despair.

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:46.020
Apathy so strong nothing matters
any more вЂ“ that's the opposite of hope.

00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:49.230
The ability to forgive anything.

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:56.990
The ability to say, "Fine," to absolutely
anything at all вЂ“ <i>that</i> is the opposite of hope.

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:02.290
You could claim it was the ultimate end point of any and all emotions.

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:08.210
Each of us looked at that point with envy and longing.

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:11.170
Beyond the tides of non-interference.

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:21.310
At the back of taboo, proud to have tied reality to
an equals sign, a place maintaining a nigh-fleeting density.

00:01:22.310 --> 00:01:26.060
To reach that place requires a great sacrifice.

00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:32.320
And only one-way tickets with no guarantees are available.

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:34.530
And yet.

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:35.650
Even then.

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:38.990
People have made it there.

00:01:40.070 --> 00:01:41.160
By accident...

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:43.790
Or by design.

00:01:45.160 --> 00:01:48.170
I'm sure this is just stupid sentiment.

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:52.460
Tedious, meaningless nonense.

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:55.170
And worst of all...

00:01:56.010 --> 00:01:58.970
There's more nonsense to come.

