00:04:29.990 --> 00:04:30.870
Sashirono!

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:33.330
What is wrong with you people!?

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.880
I can't stand any more of this!

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:40.590
Detectives? Locked rooms? Beheadedings?

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:43.720
