00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:03.820
I can't trust any of you.

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:06.410
I'm going to hide in my room.

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:09.330
I'm gonna barricade the door so no one can get in.

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:11.830
