00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:32.620
2nd Floor, Sashirono Yayoi's Room, Ext.

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:27.240
Well.

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:42.000
2nd Floor, Sashirono Yayoi's Room

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:08.900
Die!

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:13.950
I gave up so easily.

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:19.500
Dying here wouldn't cause problems for Kunagisa.

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:29.420
You don't close your eyes.

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:21.310
You should close your eyes when you're about to die.

00:08:22.390 --> 00:08:26.190
I thought you said I should try dying once.

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:27.980
Oh, that...

